OL,3,GEast Midlands                          
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly       
OL,6,Fcloudy with outbreaks of light rain    
OL,7,Fovernight. Any breaks in the cloud     
OL,8,Fshould be short lived. Heavier         
OL,9,Foutbreaks of rain across western       
OL,10,Fcounties by Saturday morning.          
OL,12,CSaturday:FRain across western counties 
OL,13,Fsoon spreads east, with some heavy     
OL,14,Foutbreaks possible at times. Breezy,   
OL,15,Fwith strong winds over high ground and 
OL,16,Falong the coast.                       
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
