OL,3,GEast Midlands                          
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunny   
OL,6,Fspells on Sunday, showers across the   
OL,7,FPeak District later. Cloudy periods    
OL,8,Fand windy on Monday. Rain moving in    
OL,9,Ffrom the northwest on Tuesday. Turning 
OL,10,Fnoticeably milder from Monday onwards. 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
